'''Orcas''' are monsters that can be found in the [[Northern Ocean]]. The player may be assigned to kill them as a [[bounty task]] starting at 80 [[Sailing]]. A guaranteed bounty task can be received from [[Etceteria]].

They drop the [[echo pearl]], which can be used to construct the [[fathom pearl]] facility.

No type of [[keel]] can fully protect against attacks from them.

